      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KALEIDOSCOPE (2) hit the frame two back then broke through last time by 2.25 lengths (19.95) at Gunnedah over 340m. Boxed well here. Yet to win here but has run some good races. Harder here but looks a top chance again. GLASS EFFECTS (6) got off the mark with her maiden win two back, then finished a 7 length third last start at Temora over 330m (19.54). Has four places this course. Expecting another good run. MASTER LEHIGH (1) goes very well at the course with two wins and a placing from six starts. Below best last time at Wagga (19.10) in a Grade 5, finishing a 2.5 lengths fourth. Can feature in the finish. FIVE LEAF CLOVER (5) can measure up with the right run.",
